windows  x86_64-w64-mingw32opt     x86_64     x86_64        opt                   VERBOSE=1                               .         v8.9

# These special lines allow us to embed default values for the columns above.
# Any column without a default mapping here will simply substitute a `.` to the empty string

# This builds LLVM and Julia twice. Allow for slower CI agents than the
# validation VM, where the build and packaging took about 100 minutes.
#default TIMEOUT 600
